  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi, how have you been?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.32,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_05"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Pretty good so far.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.58,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I didn't get the job after the final round. Is it pushy to ask for feedback?",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.23,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg13",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Not pushy at all, and it often helps. A short, polite email is the way to go.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 1.0,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "What do I say?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.97,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg13",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Thank them for their time, say you're disappointed but keen to improve, and ask if they'd share anything you could do differently.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 1.13,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "They probably won't reply.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.05,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg13",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Some won't, but plenty do. And it leaves a good impression if another role opens up.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 1.1,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I guess. I'm still",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.86,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "pretty gutted honestly.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 2.72,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg13",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's completely understandable. Getting to a final round means you were close. Give yourself a day before jumping into the next one.",
